# config.example.toml is deliberately *not* excluded: src/config.rs
# include_str!s it from its test module, and an entry here would defeat an
# explicit `COPY config.example.toml ./` with a bare "not found" that gives no
# hint the file was filtered. The Dockerfile's COPY list is explicit, so
# nothing enters the image because of this.
